          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Vacmaster_EasyClean_Large_Capacity_Carper_Cleaner.webp",
            "image_loading": "",
            "title": "Large Capacity",
            "text": "<p>The clean water tank has a large 2.5L capacity and is a separate tank from the 1.9L dirty water tank. Both tanks are removeable. Simply fill the clean water tank with detergent and water ready for spot cleaning. Empty the dirty water tank and rinse out at the end of the job.</p>",
            "url": ""
          }
